MerkleDistributorWithDeadlineTransferOwnershipTest
├── When the caller is not the owner
│   └── It should revert
└── When the caller is the owner
    ├── When the new owner is the zero address
    │   └── It should revert
    └── When the new owner is a valid address
        ├── It should transfer ownership to the new owner
        └── It should emit an OwnershipTransferred event